<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MEAL JOURNAL / 范星宇</view><view class="title">把每一餐 安排好</view><view class="subtitle">计划一餐，记下一次花费，找到自己的生活节奏。</view>
<view wx:if="{{!logged}}" class="panel"><view class="big-emoji">🗓️</view><view class="section-title">你的私人就餐日历</view><view class="muted">登录后制定计划、用餐打卡和查看每周预算。这里记录花费，不进行支付。</view><button class="primary mt" bindtap="login">去个人中心登录</button></view>
<block wx:else><view class="budget-hero"><view class="eyebrow">查看周 {{stats.start}} 至 {{stats.end}}</view><view class="row"><view><view class="muted">已记录花费</view><view class="budget-total">¥{{stats.spent}}</view></view><view><view class="badge">已打卡 {{stats.count}} 餐</view><view class="muted">待计划 ¥{{stats.planned}}</view></view></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{stats.progress}}%"></view></view><view class="muted">{{stats.over?'已超预算':'剩余预算'}} ¥{{stats.remaining}} · 已使用 {{stats.percent}}%</view></view>
<view class="wrap mt"><button class="small" data-step="-7" bindtap="week" disabled="{{prevDisabled}}">← 上一周</button><button class="small" bindtap="today">回到今天</button><button class="small" data-step="7" bindtap="week" disabled="{{nextDisabled}}">下一周 →</button></view><view class="panel"><view class="section-title">七日花费记录</view><view class="week-bars"><view wx:for="{{stats.days}}" wx:key="date" class="day-bar"><text>¥{{item.spent}}</text><view class="bar-area"><view class="bar" style="height:{{item.height}}%"></view></view><text>{{item.label}}</text></view></view><view class="row mt"><input type="digit" value="{{budget}}" data-field="budget" bindinput="input" placeholder="周预算 元"/><button class="small" bindtap="saveBudget" loading="{{budgetSaving}}" disabled="{{budgetSaving}}">保存周预算</button></view></view>
<view class="panel"><view class="section-title">{{editingId?'修改原计划':'安排一餐'}}</view><view class="field"><text class="field-title">用餐日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="{{minDate}}" end="{{maxDate}}" data-field="date" bindchange="picker">{{date}}</picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-title">餐次</text><picker range="{{meals}}" value="{{mealIndex}}" data-field="mealIndex" bindchange="picker">{{meals[mealIndex]}}</picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-title">选择菜品</text><picker range="{{dishLabels}}" value="{{dishIndex}}" data-field="dishIndex" bindchange="picker">{{dishLabels[dishIndex]||'请重新选择在售菜品'}}</picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-title">备注</text><input value="{{note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="input" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如 和室友一起去第一食堂"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存这餐计划</button><button wx:if="{{editingId}}" class="small mt" bindtap="cancelEdit">取消修改</button><view class="notice">修改日期会移动原计划，冲突时不覆盖；新建重复餐次先确认。预算采用当前设置。</view></view>
<view class="section-title">{{date}} 的安排</view><view class="panel"><view wx:if="{{!plans.length}}" class="empty">还没有安排，先选一道喜欢的菜吧。</view><view wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view class="row"><view>{{item.emoji}} {{item.dishName}}</view><text class="badge">{{item.meal}} · {{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.windowName}} · 预计 ¥{{item.price}} {{item.note}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.status==='completed'}}" class="row mt"><text>实际 ¥{{item.actual}}</text><button class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="reopen">撤销打卡</button></view><view wx:else class="wrap mt"><button class="primary small" disabled="{{item.future}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="complete">{{item.future?'未来餐次':'我吃过了 打卡'}}</button><button class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">修改</button><button class="small danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view></view>
<view class="panel"><view class="section-title">饭点提醒</view><view class="muted">{{subscription?'已选择 '+subscription.time+' · '+subscription.statusText:'尚未安排提醒'}}</view><view class="wrap mt"><button class="small" data-time="11:30" bindtap="subscribe">午餐 11:30</button><button class="small" data-time="17:30" bindtap="subscribe">晚餐 17:30</button><button class="small" bindtap="unsubscribe">关闭</button></view><view class="notice">本地模式只保存选择，不发消息。微信模式每次需要主动授权，成功后消耗一次名额。</view></view>
<view class="panel"><view class="section-title">最近打卡</view><view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" class="record row"><view>{{item.dishName}}<view class="muted">{{item.date}} · {{item.meal}}</view></view><text class="price">¥{{item.actual}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!history.length}}" class="muted">完成第一餐打卡后，就能在这里回顾。</view></view></block><view class="owner">计划 日历 预算 打卡 提醒负责人 · 范星宇</view></view>
